   {
    "text": "Light orchestral travel music in the Victorian manner, a mail steamer under way, strings and woodwinds over a steady engine pulse",
    "weight": 1.1
   },
   {
    "text": "Slow marimba and low strings like a ship's engine, a smoke trail on the horizon, the sea going by",
    "weight": 0.8
   },
   {
    "text": "Precise pizzicato and a ticking celesta, an Englishman who never hurries, wide sea air",
    "weight": 0.5
   },
   {
    "text": "Moonlit sea at night: solo cello and harp, a tender pause at the rail, the engine far below",
    "weight": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Oriental colour in a European orchestra, Suez in the sun, oud and clarinet over light strings",
    "weight": 0
